      "source": [
        "# AISA-ArabicFC — FunctionGemma LoRA fine-tune\n",
        "\n",
        "Team **Ṣaqr (صقر)**. notebook:\n",
        "1. Trains on the **train** split (10,550), scores on **dev** (545) — no leakage.\n",
        "2. Uses each row's **own `text`** field → all 27 tools + correct schema kept automatically (no hand-listed 5 tools, no rebuilt prompt).\n",
        "3. `train_on_responses_only` masks the declaration prompt (loss only on the answer).\n",
        "4. Self-contained scorer + post-processing → prints real before/after ArgEM.\n",
        "5. Modern `SFTConfig` API so it runs.\n",
        "\n",
        "Baseline to beat: **Overall A 0.766** (post-processed baseline model)."
      ],
      "id": "M-TT3ZFfn-RX"
    },
